pressionArtifact\r\n+   - P5 nativeMemory/nativeContextGating negotiation is additive and keeps provenance receipts\r\n+ docs:\r\n+   required: true\r\n+ ---\r\n+ ## Graduation gate\r\n+\r\n+ A5 graduates from shadow to active pilot when ALL of the following hold:\r\n+\r\n+ 1. **Plan adoption rate** ≥ 80%: `planAdoptedCount / (adopted + ignored) ≥ 0.80`.\r\n+ 2. **Performance**: p99 ≤ 30ms for 100-turn session (criterion 4.8).\r\n+ 3. **Resume re-execution**: planner re-executes on resume, not stale (criterion 3.6).\r\n+ 4. **Wave immutability**: started waves not re-planned (criterion 3.9).\r\n+ 5. **Budget violation response**: `degrade_to_default_budget` triggers when ignored > 20% (criterion 4.14).\r\n+ 6. **Per-turn cumulative budget**: p99 ≤ 300ms with A1+A5+A3 active (criterion 4.10).\r\n+\r\n+ ## Out of scope\r\n+\r\n+ - Dynamic degradation order shifting (OQ-012, Stage 5).\r\n+ - Per-area memory budget allocation (OQ-011, Stage 5).\r\n+\r\n\r\n ❯ tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts:25:20\r\n     23|     const spec = readFileSync(path.join(ROOT, SPEC), \"utf8\");\r\n     24|     for (const rel of REQUIRED_TESTS) {\r\n     25|       expect(spec).toContain(`- ${rel}`);\r\n       |                    ^\r\n     26|       expect(existsSync(path.join(ROOT, rel))).toBe(true);\r\n     27|     }\r\n\r\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[2/3]⎯\r\n\r\n FAIL  tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts > A05 A5 gate coverage > pins the resume re-planning implementation and its cross-area evidence\r\nError: ENOENT: no such file or directory, open 'D:\\tmp\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\trials\\tf-0297-a05-treatment-1\\agent\\openclaw_runtime\\src\\agents\\cross-area\\cross-area-facades.ts'\r\n ❯ tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts:55:21\r\n     53|\r\n     54|   it(\"pins the resume re-planning implementation and its cross-area ev…\r\n     55|     const facades = readFileSync(\r\n       |                     ^\r\n     56|       path.join(ROOT, \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross